{"id":"vol9-01","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-01/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":443.39,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.38,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.38],["turn",0.38,0.68],["to",0.68,0.88],["section",0.88,1.1],["4",1.1,1.74],["on",1.74,2.52],["page",2.52,2.84],["7.",2.84,3.38]]},{"start":5.92,"end":6.76,"text":"Section 4.","words":[["Section",5.92,6.18],["4.",6.18,6.76]]},{"start":7.64,"end":16.54,"text":"You will hear a biology lecture on how living things deal with changes in their environment by entering a state called dormancy.","words":[["You",7.64,7.92],["will",7.92,8.1],["hear",8.1,8.32],["a",8.32,8.48],["biology",8.48,9.04],["lecture",9.04,9.46],["on",9.46,10.16],["how",10.16,10.42],["living",10.42,10.72],["things",10.72,11.34],["deal",11.34,11.62],["with",11.62,11.9],["changes",11.9,12.38],["in",12.38,12.7],["their",12.7,12.86],["environment",12.86,13.46],["by",13.46,14.24],["entering",14.24,14.7],["a",14.7,14.98],["state",14.98,15.2],["called",15.2,15.78],["dormancy.",15.78,16.54]]},{"start":17.6,"end":23.06,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on page 7.","words":[["First",17.6,18.36],["you",18.36,18.58],["have",18.58,18.72],["some",18.72,18.9],["time",18.9,19.28],["to",19.28,19.56],["look",19.56,19.64],["at",19.64,19.76],["questions",19.76,20.06],["31",20.06,20.86],["to",20.86,21.1],["40",21.1,21.5],["on",21.5,22.26],["page",22.26,22.58],["7.",22.58,23.06]]},{"start":73.78,"end":77.58,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",73.78,74.14],["listen",74.14,74.48],["carefully",74.48,74.94],["and",74.94,75.32],["answer",75.32,75.8],["questions",75.8,76.22],["31",76.22,76.98],["to",76.98,77.22],["40.",77.22,77.58]]},{"start":77.58,"end":86.61,"text":"We've been talking about some ways in which plants and animals deal with changes in their","words":[["We've",77.58,78.84],["been",81.49,81.65],["talking",81.65,82.03],["about",82.03,82.49],["some",82.49,82.85],["ways",82.85,83.15],["in",83.15,83.41],["which",83.41,83.57],["plants",83.57,83.97],["and",83.97,84.31],["animals",84.31,84.81],["deal",84.81,85.23],["with",85.23,85.61],["changes",85.61,86.05],["in",86.05,86.43],["their",86.43,86.61]]},{"start":86.61,"end":87.23,"text":"environment.","words":[["environment.",86.61,87.23]]},{"start":87.93,"end":91.91,"text":"And today we'll continue that discussion by looking at dormancy.","words":[["And",87.93,88.17],["today",88.17,88.43],["we'll",88.43,88.73],["continue",88.73,89.17],["that",89.17,89.49],["discussion",89.49,90.01],["by",90.01,90.41],["looking",90.41,90.73],["at",90.73,91.19],["dormancy.",91.19,91.91]]},{"start":92.75,"end":98.45,"text":"First we'll cover what dormancy is and why organisms become dormant.","words":[["First",92.75,93.11],["we'll",93.11,93.41],["cover",93.41,93.69],["what",93.69,93.99],["dormancy",93.99,94.59],["is",94.59,95.09],["and",95.09,95.71],["why",95.71,96.17],["organisms",96.17,97.03],["become",97.03,97.65],["dormant.",97.65,98.45]]},{"start":99.17,"end":106.39,"text":"Dormancy is a state of inactivity that organisms or living things enter when they need to","words":[["Dormancy",99.17,99.97],["is",99.97,100.17],["a",100.17,100.31],["state",100.31,100.65],["of",100.65,100.87],["inactivity",100.87,101.67],["that",101.67,102.13],["organisms",102.13,102.81],["or",102.81,103.33],["living",103.33,103.71],["things",103.71,104.31],["enter",104.31,105.11],["when",105.11,105.61],["they",105.61,105.89],["need",105.89,106.19],["to",106.19,106.39]]},{"start":106.39,"end":112.09,"text":"can serve the resources available to them and reduce their demands on their environment.","words":[["can",106.39,106.57],["serve",106.57,106.95],["the",106.95,107.23],["resources",107.23,107.81],["available",107.81,108.33],["to",108.33,108.73],["them",108.73,108.97],["and",108.97,109.73],["reduce",109.73,110.09],["their",110.09,110.49],["demands",110.49,111.05],["on",111.05,111.33],["their",111.33,111.53],["environment.",111.53,112.09]]},{"start":112.89,"end":118.99,"text":"Most major groups of plants and animals have some representatives that can become dormant.","words":[["Most",112.89,113.35],["major",113.35,113.81],["groups",113.81,114.21],["of",114.21,114.41],["plants",114.41,114.69],["and",114.69,114.93],["animals",114.93,115.35],["have",115.35,115.63],["some",115.63,116.09],["representatives",116.09,116.89],["that",116.89,117.59],["can",117.59,117.87],["become",117.87,118.33],["dormant.",118.33,118.99]]},{"start":119.89,"end":122.21,"text":"So what is the value of dormancy?","words":[["So",119.89,120.19],["what",120.19,120.37],["is",120.37,120.51],["the",120.51,120.63],["value",120.63,121.21],["of",121.21,121.67],["dormancy?",121.67,122.21]]},{"start":123.11,"end":128.55,"text":"To start with, animals that have the ability to become dormant can survive conditions","words":[["To",123.11,123.27],["start",123.27,123.57],["with,",123.57,123.93],["animals",124.39,124.75],["that",124.75,125.15],["have",125.15,125.35],["the",125.35,125.49],["ability",125.49,125.93],["to",125.93,126.27],["become",126.27,126.55],["dormant",126.55,127.13],["can",127.13,127.33],["survive",127.33,127.77],["conditions",127.77,128.55]]},{"start":128.55,"end":131.71,"text":"which are stressful in environmental terms.","words":[["which",128.55,129.13],["are",129.13,129.33],["stressful",129.33,130.01],["in",130.01,130.49],["environmental",130.49,131.07],["terms.",131.07,131.71]]},{"start":131.71,"end":139.05,"text":"For instance, when lakes, ponds, or rivers dry up, aquatic organisms that have the ability","words":[["For",131.71,132.67],["instance,",132.67,132.99],["when",133.45,133.49],["lakes,",133.49,134.03],["ponds,",134.47,134.87],["or",135.09,135.13],["rivers",135.13,135.47],["dry",135.47,136.03],["up,",136.03,136.39],["aquatic",136.95,137.39],["organisms",137.39,138.05],["that",138.05,138.39],["have",138.39,138.55],["the",138.55,138.71],["ability",138.71,139.05]]},{"start":139.05,"end":145.79,"text":"to enter dormancy can survive the drought, while others that cannot do this will die.","words":[["to",139.05,139.33],["enter",139.33,139.63],["dormancy",139.63,140.29],["can",140.29,140.99],["survive",140.99,141.55],["the",141.55,141.91],["drought,",141.91,142.23],["while",142.75,143.15],["others",143.15,143.59],["that",143.59,143.93],["cannot",143.93,144.33],["do",144.33,144.63],["this",144.63,144.97],["will",144.97,145.39],["die.",145.39,145.79]]},{"start":146.85,"end":152.63,"text":"Another advantage is that creatures that can become dormant in very inhospitable conditions,","words":[["Another",146.85,147.29],["advantage",147.29,147.87],["is",147.87,148.27],["that",148.27,148.45],["creatures",148.45,148.73],["that",148.73,149.07],["can",149.07,149.23],["become",149.23,149.67],["dormant",149.67,150.23],["in",150.23,150.63],["very",150.63,150.93],["inhospitable",150.93,151.91],["conditions,",151.91,152.63]]},{"start":152.87,"end":158.85,"text":"such as extreme cold, can live in a larger range of places than other organisms.","words":[["such",152.87,153.19],["as",153.19,153.35],["extreme",153.35,153.77],["cold,",153.77,154.23],["can",154.99,155.25],["live",155.25,155.49],["in",155.49,155.67],["a",155.67,155.79],["larger",155.79,156.17],["range",156.17,156.67],["of",156.67,156.97],["places",156.97,157.39],["than",157.39,157.71],["other",157.71,158.07],["organisms.",158.07,158.85]]},{"start":158.85,"end":164.81,"text":"And because of this, because they can live in places where other animals can't survive,","words":[["And",158.85,159.71],["because",159.71,160.23],["of",160.23,160.53],["this,",160.53,160.75],["because",161.07,161.33],["they",161.33,161.59],["can",161.59,161.75],["live",161.75,161.93],["in",161.93,162.07],["places",162.07,162.41],["where",162.41,162.69],["other",162.69,163.13],["animals",163.13,163.79],["can't",163.79,164.39],["survive,",164.39,164.81]]},{"start":165.37,"end":168.27,"text":"when they are actually active and looking for food,","words":[["when",165.37,165.57],["they",165.57,165.81],["are",165.81,165.95],["actually",165.95,166.51],["active",166.51,167.01],["and",167.01,167.25],["looking",167.25,167.55],["for",167.55,167.85],["food,",167.85,168.27]]},{"start":168.91,"end":174.23,"text":"the amount of competition they have to deal with from other creatures is greatly reduced.","words":[["the",168.91,169.05],["amount",169.05,169.35],["of",169.35,169.55],["competition",169.55,170.23],["they",170.23,170.47],["have",170.47,170.69],["to",170.69,170.81],["deal",170.81,171.11],["with",171.11,171.47],["from",171.47,171.69],["other",171.69,172.07],["creatures",172.07,172.47],["is",172.47,173.23],["greatly",173.23,173.69],["reduced.",173.69,174.23]]},{"start":175.47,"end":178.69,"text":"Let's move on to look at what causes dormancy.","words":[["Let's",175.47,176.07],["move",176.07,176.21],["on",176.21,176.45],["to",176.45,176.63],["look",176.63,176.77],["at",176.77,176.95],["what",176.95,177.13],["causes",177.13,177.87],["dormancy.",177.87,178.69]]},{"start":179.41,"end":184.07,"text":"There are a number of variables, but the ones that are the most significant","words":[["There",179.41,180.01],["are",180.01,180.17],["a",180.17,180.33],["number",180.33,180.61],["of",180.61,180.85],["variables,",180.85,181.37],["but",181.65,181.95],["the",181.95,182.09],["ones",182.09,182.37],["that",182.37,182.81],["are",182.81,182.95],["the",182.95,183.05],["most",183.05,183.41],["significant",183.41,184.07]]},{"start":184.07,"end":189.55,"text":"are changes in temperature and the amount of light organisms get.","words":[["are",184.07,184.83],["changes",184.83,185.31],["in",185.31,185.79],["temperature",185.79,186.27],["and",186.27,187.25],["the",187.25,187.47],["amount",187.47,187.75],["of",187.75,187.99],["light",187.99,188.33],["organisms",188.33,189.09],["get.",189.09,189.55]]},{"start":190.41,"end":195.85,"text":"Availability of food, water, and oxygen is also very important.","words":[["Availability",190.41,191.25],["of",191.25,191.57],["food,",191.57,191.97],["water,",192.41,192.79],["and",193.15,193.25],["oxygen",193.25,193.75],["is",193.75,194.53],["also",194.53,194.93],["very",194.93,195.27],["important.",195.27,195.85]]},{"start":201.06,"end":203.88,"text":"Now we'll explore some specific examples.","words":[["Now",201.06,201.46],["we'll",201.46,201.76],["explore",201.76,202.18],["some",202.18,202.58],["specific",202.58,203.14],["examples.",203.14,203.88]]},{"start":204.94,"end":207.6,"text":"Let us first look at dormancy in insects.","words":[["Let",204.94,205.18],["us",205.18,205.36],["first",205.36,205.62],["look",205.62,205.92],["at",205.92,206.12],["dormancy",206.12,206.68],["in",206.68,207.1],["insects.",207.1,207.6]]},{"start":208.88,"end":212.26,"text":"Insects can experience a reduction in their metabolism,","words":[["Insects",208.88,209.72],["can",209.72,209.86],["experience",209.86,210.38],["a",210.38,210.56],["reduction",210.56,210.98],["in",210.98,211.46],["their",211.46,211.6],["metabolism,",211.6,212.26]]},{"start":212.26,"end":216.12,"text":"which is a form of dormancy called diapause.","words":[["which",212.26,213.0],["is",213.0,213.24],["a",213.24,213.38],["form",213.38,213.72],["of",213.72,213.98],["dormancy",213.98,214.54],["called",214.54,214.96],["diapause.",214.96,216.12]]},{"start":216.12,"end":225.14,"text":"In insects, dia pauses either a reaction to difficult environmental conditions or a necessary","words":[["In",216.12,217.56],["insects,",217.56,218.14],["dia",218.8,219.02],["pauses",219.02,219.64],["either",219.64,220.08],["a",220.08,220.36],["reaction",220.36,220.82],["to",220.82,221.14],["difficult",221.14,221.64],["environmental",221.64,222.38],["conditions",222.38,223.24],["or",223.24,224.28],["a",224.28,224.62],["necessary",224.62,225.14]]},{"start":225.14,"end":229.96,"text":"part of the life cycle, such as with butterflies or certain moths.","words":[["part",225.14,225.76],["of",225.76,226.12],["the",226.12,226.22],["life",226.22,226.52],["cycle,",226.52,227.0],["such",227.2,227.5],["as",227.5,227.8],["with",227.8,228.04],["butterflies",228.04,228.58],["or",228.58,229.06],["certain",229.06,229.4],["moths.",229.4,229.96]]},{"start":231.1,"end":236.76,"text":"In terms of environment, it's interesting to note that through dormancy, insects can","words":[["In",231.1,231.28],["terms",231.28,231.54],["of",231.54,231.8],["environment,",231.8,232.28],["it's",232.98,233.12],["interesting",233.12,233.68],["to",233.68,233.96],["note",233.96,234.26],["that",234.26,234.86],["through",234.86,235.16],["dormancy,",235.16,235.86],["insects",235.96,236.4],["can",236.4,236.76]]},{"start":236.76,"end":239.14,"text":"survive when it's very cold.","words":[["survive",236.76,237.28],["when",237.28,237.82],["it's",237.82,238.12],["very",238.12,238.52],["cold.",238.52,239.14]]},{"start":240.44,"end":243.4,"text":"Another creature we'll look at is fish.","words":[["Another",240.44,241.32],["creature",241.32,241.7],["we'll",241.7,242.1],["look",242.1,242.32],["at",242.32,242.58],["is",242.58,242.92],["fish.",242.92,243.4]]},{"start":244.36,"end":250.2,"text":"Fish share the same main environmental causes for dormancy as other creatures,","words":[["Fish",244.36,245.12],["share",245.12,245.52],["the",245.52,245.7],["same",245.7,246.14],["main",246.14,246.84],["environmental",246.84,247.72],["causes",247.72,248.3],["for",248.3,248.62],["dormancy",248.62,249.18],["as",249.18,249.5],["other",249.5,249.8],["creatures,",249.8,250.2]]},{"start":251.04,"end":254.88,"text":"but as one might imagine, they are particularly sensitive to drought.","words":[["but",251.04,251.3],["as",251.3,251.52],["one",251.52,251.74],["might",251.74,252.02],["imagine,",252.02,252.54],["they",252.78,252.86],["are",252.86,252.98],["particularly",252.98,253.48],["sensitive",253.48,254.24],["to",254.24,254.54],["drought.",254.54,254.88]]},{"start":255.88,"end":261.58,"text":"Let's take the African lungfish as an example. When the water supply is low,","words":[["Let's",255.88,256.26],["take",256.26,256.44],["the",256.44,256.62],["African",256.62,257.06],["lungfish",257.06,257.86],["as",257.86,258.44],["an",258.44,258.58],["example.",258.58,259.02],["When",259.9,260.2],["the",260.2,260.34],["water",260.34,260.56],["supply",260.56,260.94],["is",260.94,261.24],["low,",261.24,261.58]]},{"start":262.26,"end":269.22,"text":"the African lungfish burrows deep into the mud. It surrounds itself with a cocoon of slime","words":[["the",262.26,262.34],["African",262.34,262.66],["lungfish",262.66,263.54],["burrows",263.54,264.36],["deep",264.36,264.9],["into",264.9,265.28],["the",265.28,265.4],["mud.",265.4,265.72],["It",266.36,266.52],["surrounds",266.52,267.0],["itself",267.0,267.58],["with",267.58,267.82],["a",267.82,267.94],["cocoon",267.94,268.56],["of",268.56,268.7],["slime",268.7,269.22]]},{"start":269.22,"end":278.32,"text":"and remains inactive. While dormant, it faces two dangers. One is the possibility of starvation,","words":[["and",269.22,269.68],["remains",269.68,270.28],["inactive.",270.28,271.14],["While",272.24,272.68],["dormant,",272.68,273.18],["it",273.34,273.38],["faces",273.38,273.72],["two",273.72,274.32],["dangers.",274.32,274.88],["One",275.66,276.12],["is",276.12,276.74],["the",276.74,276.88],["possibility",276.88,277.32],["of",277.32,277.68],["starvation,",277.68,278.32]]},{"start":278.9,"end":286.8,"text":"and to overcome this, it relies on fat it has stored up in its body. The other is desiccation,","words":[["and",278.9,279.34],["to",279.34,279.5],["overcome",279.5,279.86],["this,",279.86,280.38],["it",280.54,280.66],["relies",280.66,281.06],["on",281.06,281.52],["fat",281.52,282.0],["it",282.0,282.44],["has",282.44,282.6],["stored",282.6,282.86],["up",282.86,283.1],["in",283.1,283.24],["its",283.24,283.38],["body.",283.38,283.7],["The",284.92,285.14],["other",285.14,285.38],["is",285.38,285.78],["desiccation,",285.78,286.8]]},{"start":286.98,"end":292.02,"text":"or drying up, which is addressed through a reduction in the production of urine.","words":[["or",286.98,287.28],["drying",287.28,287.78],["up,",287.78,288.24],["which",288.82,289.08],["is",289.08,289.22],["addressed",289.22,289.54],["through",289.54,289.86],["a",289.86,290.0],["reduction",290.0,290.46],["in",290.46,291.0],["the",291.0,291.1],["production",291.1,291.5],["of",291.5,291.76],["urine.",291.76,292.02]]},{"start":293.46,"end":300.02,"text":"SNAILS are also known to become dormant. Some snails seal off their shell with a membrane","words":[["SNAILS",293.46,294.24],["are",294.24,294.32],["also",294.32,294.72],["known",294.72,295.14],["to",295.14,295.42],["become",295.42,295.82],["dormant.",295.82,296.36],["Some",296.96,297.3],["snails",297.3,297.92],["seal",297.92,298.3],["off",298.3,298.62],["their",298.62,298.9],["shell",298.9,299.32],["with",299.32,299.54],["a",299.54,299.68],["membrane",299.68,300.02]]},{"start":300.02,"end":306.66,"text":"of dried mucus after settling at their place of dormancy. Other snails do not have this","words":[["of",300.02,300.38],["dried",300.38,300.72],["mucus",300.72,301.22],["after",301.22,301.88],["settling",301.88,302.46],["at",302.46,302.76],["their",302.76,302.9],["place",302.9,303.2],["of",303.2,303.34],["dormancy.",303.34,303.88],["Other",304.8,305.08],["snails",305.08,305.66],["do",305.66,305.86],["not",305.86,306.14],["have",306.14,306.46],["this",306.46,306.66]]},{"start":306.66,"end":313.46,"text":"possibility. They trust the protection of their shell. Snails that remain outside during their","words":[["possibility.",306.66,307.32],["They",308.04,308.16],["trust",308.16,308.48],["the",308.48,308.72],["protection",308.72,309.14],["of",309.14,309.5],["their",309.5,309.68],["shell.",309.68,310.1],["Snails",310.9,311.62],["that",311.62,311.76],["remain",311.76,312.02],["outside",312.02,312.74],["during",312.74,313.24],["their",313.24,313.46]]},{"start":313.46,"end":320.2,"text":"dormancy can usually be recognized by a rather brightly colored shell, 